WEBVTT

00:00:01.858 --> 00:00:10.926
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:20.667
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:30.482
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.754 --> 00:00:39.890
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:40.297 --> 00:00:50.434
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.441 --> 00:00:57.402
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.614 --> 00:01:01.015
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:01.184 --> 00:01:06.850
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:10.517
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.694 --> 00:01:19.693
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:33.717 --> 00:01:37.619
If you want to fight,
I'll take you on, boys...

00:01:37.854 --> 00:01:40.982
Whenever, wherever,
as often as you like...

00:01:42.859 --> 00:01:46.386
If we're going to do it,
don't bother with the scraps...

00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:48.895
...bring on the real men!

00:01:49.032 --> 00:01:51.193
Crap!

00:01:59.175 --> 00:02:00.142
Why?

00:02:00.977 --> 00:02:03.070
Why didn't she kill them?

00:02:22.699 --> 00:02:26.465
<i>Episode 6
The Balloonist. Mikan's Revenge</i>

00:02:32.609 --> 00:02:35.271
Touka... Touka!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:44.946
Daddy!

00:02:45.622 --> 00:02:47.180
Mommy!

00:02:52.328 --> 00:02:57.732
Stupid balloonist, you should
have handed over the money.

00:02:57.867 --> 00:03:02.463
This is what happens when you
disobey the great Ganzo Tenma.

00:03:03.139 --> 00:03:06.870
What's that look for? I won't go
easy on you just because you're a kid.

00:03:06.976 --> 00:03:08.773
Anyone who disobeys me...

00:03:16.586 --> 00:03:17.814
Who the hell are you?

00:03:17.921 --> 00:03:18.546
Heh...

00:03:25.195 --> 00:03:26.822
Touka Kurenai.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:30.227
Drill that name into that stupid
looking head of yours.

00:03:37.607 --> 00:03:40.974
Did you lose your family?

00:03:42.445 --> 00:03:43.036
Yeah.

00:03:43.646 --> 00:03:45.841
We're all alone, too.

00:03:46.349 --> 00:03:47.441
We?

00:03:48.118 --> 00:03:50.916
All of us who have lost our homes.

00:03:53.256 --> 00:03:56.987
Wanna make a home together?

00:03:59.529 --> 00:04:01.895
Touka!

00:04:09.439 --> 00:04:10.371
Touka!

00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:12.667
Touka!

00:04:16.312 --> 00:04:17.472
Mikan...

00:04:20.884 --> 00:04:22.010
Ow...

00:04:22.485 --> 00:04:24.544
That stupid coward.

00:04:24.787 --> 00:04:27.654
What a mess he made.

00:04:27.891 --> 00:04:29.324
Miss Touka!

00:04:30.627 --> 00:04:32.390
Are you okay?

00:04:32.495 --> 00:04:33.427
Yeah.

00:04:35.331 --> 00:04:37.663
A loud boom, then a direct hit.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.826
I have no idea where he got it,
but it must be a cannon.

00:04:40.937 --> 00:04:45.931
Based on the time it took to get here, it
must've been shot from quite a distance.

00:04:46.176 --> 00:04:49.942
I can't believe they're able to use it
in this mountainous terrain.

00:04:50.146 --> 00:04:53.013
It most likely came from
the direction of that hill.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.349
Mikan, hold it!

00:04:55.985 --> 00:04:58.749
That idiot! What can she do alone?

00:04:59.022 --> 00:04:59.954
Stop!

00:05:00.423 --> 00:05:01.185
Miss Touka!

00:05:01.624 --> 00:05:04.855
This damn body... of all the times...

00:05:04.961 --> 00:05:06.428
Are you okay?

00:05:06.529 --> 00:05:08.690
Yeah... I'm fine...

00:05:09.165 --> 00:05:11.292
Take care of Mikan.

00:05:11.434 --> 00:05:14.267
She's trying to avenge
her parents' death.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.564
I heard.

00:05:16.105 --> 00:05:20.906
I don't want her to go through that.
You understand, right, Rushuna?

00:05:21.044 --> 00:05:21.703
Yes.

00:05:23.513 --> 00:05:24.605
Rushuna...

00:05:25.748 --> 00:05:27.545
I'm sorry.

00:05:28.117 --> 00:05:29.880
Ganzo!

00:05:30.019 --> 00:05:32.817
Mikan! Wait!

00:05:39.462 --> 00:05:40.622
Another one?

00:05:40.797 --> 00:05:43.322
Everyone! Hide behind the buildings!

00:05:45.168 --> 00:05:49.229
I can't let them destroy a place
that took such good care of us.

00:05:51.274 --> 00:05:52.571
I will...

00:05:54.043 --> 00:05:55.567
...split them in half.

00:06:04.254 --> 00:06:06.586
Very impressive, Yajiro Kojima.

00:06:06.723 --> 00:06:09.920
So the name "Tiger of the
Rear Guard" is justified.

00:06:10.059 --> 00:06:12.027
Huh? What happened?

00:06:12.161 --> 00:06:14.254
Ganzo!

00:06:14.397 --> 00:06:15.921
Who's that?

00:06:16.032 --> 00:06:18.296
Ganzo! Just you wait!

00:06:21.704 --> 00:06:24.036
I, Mikan Kurenai will kill you.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:27.573
Mikan Kurenai?
Where are you from, brat?

00:06:27.677 --> 00:06:29.770
She's the brat from Toukarou.

00:06:30.813 --> 00:06:33.976
Then we'll use you as bait to get Touka.

00:06:36.552 --> 00:06:38.486
Great! Good catch!

00:06:38.621 --> 00:06:39.110
What!

00:06:39.756 --> 00:06:41.189
What is it?

00:06:41.324 --> 00:06:44.487
It's a balloon! It's a balloon doll!

00:06:44.861 --> 00:06:46.556
Balloon?

00:06:47.664 --> 00:06:49.325
I remember now.

00:06:49.465 --> 00:06:52.491
She's the daughter of the
balloon maker. Where did she go?

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:55.901
Ganzo!

00:06:56.706 --> 00:06:57.674
Eagle Shoot!

00:06:57.674 --> 00:06:59.801
<i>EAGLE BALLOON SHOOT
Eagle Shoot!</i>

00:07:03.379 --> 00:07:04.311
Boss!

00:07:04.447 --> 00:07:06.142
Don't underestimate us, you brat!

00:07:10.787 --> 00:07:11.811
Rushuna!

00:07:12.455 --> 00:07:14.719
You! Who do you think you are?

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:23.130
Let's not be so brutish.

00:07:23.232 --> 00:07:24.028
Huh?

00:07:24.233 --> 00:07:26.701
Is she a friend of that brat's?

00:07:26.869 --> 00:07:29.099
The Toukarou has some great women.

00:07:29.238 --> 00:07:31.206
No! She's from this morning.

00:07:32.141 --> 00:07:33.335
Her?

00:07:33.643 --> 00:07:34.667
Kill her!

00:07:35.478 --> 00:07:38.379
So this is how it's going to be.

00:07:38.481 --> 00:07:40.881
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot her to death!

00:07:41.617 --> 00:07:43.346
Let's not do this.

00:07:43.486 --> 00:07:44.282
What!

00:07:57.367 --> 00:08:01.326
This brave girl is none other
than Rushuna Tendo.

00:08:01.537 --> 00:08:05.735
Who would have thought that the
fugitive would be in these parts.

00:08:06.209 --> 00:08:10.703
She's the perfect prey for me
to show off my technology.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.441
It was worth teaming up
with those mountain monkeys.

00:08:22.925 --> 00:08:25.894
Wow! By herself too...

00:08:27.196 --> 00:08:31.098
She's not killing them.
She's missing all their vitals!

00:08:31.234 --> 00:08:32.258
Why?

00:08:32.435 --> 00:08:34.733
Why doesn't she kill them?

00:08:38.408 --> 00:08:41.275
So Mister, you still want to fight?

00:08:41.644 --> 00:08:44.044
Or will you give up?

00:08:44.313 --> 00:08:48.545
If you behave,
I'll entertain you at Toukarou.

00:08:57.593 --> 00:09:01.791
No surrender, no entertaining!

00:09:04.167 --> 00:09:06.067
Professor, do it!

00:09:28.057 --> 00:09:33.324
You've been adept at dodging the
attacks of my invention, Kibanten.

00:09:35.331 --> 00:09:38.164
My name is Banmaru Zoushi.

00:09:38.601 --> 00:09:41.866
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:09:42.004 --> 00:09:42.936
Rushuna!

00:09:47.043 --> 00:09:48.374
Why'd you do that?

00:09:48.511 --> 00:09:51.912
Don't come, Mikan.

00:09:52.982 --> 00:09:56.577
And you mustn't seek revenge.

00:09:57.954 --> 00:09:58.750
Why?

00:09:59.555 --> 00:10:02.683
Miss Touka could have killed them...

00:10:03.759 --> 00:10:05.249
...but she didn't.

00:10:07.296 --> 00:10:08.092
But...

00:10:09.832 --> 00:10:13.495
But what am I supposed to do
with these feelings I have?

00:10:15.605 --> 00:10:16.594
Watch.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.434
Girl, we will play to
our heart's content.

00:10:22.178 --> 00:10:24.169
Okay, I'm fine now.

00:10:25.047 --> 00:10:25.911
No!

00:10:26.048 --> 00:10:28.915
Watch out! Watch out! Watch out!

00:10:29.051 --> 00:10:31.645
Agile like a mouse!

00:10:31.854 --> 00:10:32.548
Squeak!

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:35.218
Squeak!

00:10:35.324 --> 00:10:37.724
Damn you, girl!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.260
I'd like to see your face.

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.895
But unless you take off
that clumsy armor...

00:10:44.233 --> 00:10:47.100
What is she saying?
Her life is in danger.

00:10:48.538 --> 00:10:51.871
I cannot believe you've
stood up to Kibanten this far!

00:10:51.974 --> 00:10:54.340
Your skills are impressive.

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:55.807
Thank you.

00:10:56.178 --> 00:11:01.138
Tenshi put a price on your head herself.
If I kill you, I will be made a Juttensen.

00:11:01.317 --> 00:11:03.217
Is that what you're after?

00:11:03.319 --> 00:11:07.346
It will get me there faster than
killing your friend from the brothel.

00:11:12.828 --> 00:11:13.590
Huh?

00:11:16.332 --> 00:11:17.924
Oh no!

00:11:18.834 --> 00:11:20.802
<i>OUTOF BULLETS</i>

00:11:38.554 --> 00:11:40.351
What agility!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:45.152
It's like her body is a spring!
That girl is a bundle of reflexes!

00:11:45.328 --> 00:11:47.523
Then I will stop her feet!

00:11:55.471 --> 00:11:58.031
She ran away. Where did you go?

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:00.506
Um, time out!

00:12:00.643 --> 00:12:01.905
What!

00:12:02.612 --> 00:12:05.137
There is no time out during battle!

00:12:05.247 --> 00:12:07.807
But, um, er...

00:12:07.984 --> 00:12:11.215
My panties got ripped!

00:12:11.387 --> 00:12:12.877
P-Panties!

00:12:13.489 --> 00:12:18.756
This is a ploy to get me to
let my guard down, isn't it?

00:12:18.995 --> 00:12:20.462
No, it isn't!

00:12:20.563 --> 00:12:22.258
I'm not falling for it!

00:12:22.365 --> 00:12:26.461
All you've been doing is running,
and you're not attacking at all.

00:12:26.836 --> 00:12:28.326
Why is that?

00:12:29.205 --> 00:12:31.105
You're out of bullets, aren't you?

00:12:31.207 --> 00:12:32.765
Both are true.

00:12:34.877 --> 00:12:36.344
There you are, girl!

00:12:36.445 --> 00:12:38.845
I can't use my agility!

00:12:39.148 --> 00:12:40.740
Hang on, Rushuna!

00:12:40.916 --> 00:12:42.110
Who's there?

00:12:42.284 --> 00:12:44.616
Oh, this is cool.

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:48.483
Give it back! I'm going
to rescue Rushuna!

00:12:48.591 --> 00:12:51.458
It's not safe here, go back to Toukarou.

00:12:51.594 --> 00:12:54.222
Did Touka send you here? Give it back!

00:12:54.363 --> 00:12:55.921
Rushuna's fine.

00:12:56.065 --> 00:13:00.024
No she isn't! She's out of bullets,
and all she can do is run.

00:13:00.269 --> 00:13:04.933
She's going to get killed! I can't
just sit back and watch anymore.

00:13:05.374 --> 00:13:07.103
Give this to her.

00:13:07.209 --> 00:13:09.040
What am I going to do?

00:13:09.178 --> 00:13:11.112
Rushuna, above you!

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:19.583
Huh? An ally?

00:13:19.755 --> 00:13:21.814
There was a little brat earlier...

00:13:22.224 --> 00:13:24.249
Thanks, Yatchan!

00:13:24.393 --> 00:13:26.190
Thank Mikan!

00:13:26.328 --> 00:13:29.559
There's one more thing I need.

00:13:29.765 --> 00:13:30.925
What is it?

00:13:31.067 --> 00:13:34.901
My panties ripped and it's hard
to move. I need new ones!

00:13:35.004 --> 00:13:37.063
Okay, p-panties?

00:13:40.009 --> 00:13:41.977
<i>YATCHAN, PLEASE!</i>

00:13:42.211 --> 00:13:45.476
Let me go, I want to
keep an eye on Rushuna.

00:13:45.614 --> 00:13:47.206
No, you're going back!

00:13:47.316 --> 00:13:49.910
Rushuna will win. Don't worry about her!

00:13:50.052 --> 00:13:53.283
We need to get her panties.
There are some at Toukarou, right?

00:13:53.389 --> 00:13:55.357
Where in Toukarou are they?

00:13:56.158 --> 00:13:57.648
Hey, answer...

00:13:58.861 --> 00:14:00.556
When the hell!

00:14:05.701 --> 00:14:08.602
So you have bullets now,
but what can you do?

00:14:08.704 --> 00:14:09.728
Take this!

00:14:26.756 --> 00:14:28.849
That marksmanship was...

00:14:29.492 --> 00:14:30.857
...Collision Spark!

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.928
<i>COLLISION SPARK</i>

00:14:33.028 --> 00:14:36.862
In a split second she identified
which bullets were going to...

00:14:36.999 --> 00:14:40.594
...hit her and accurately
fired bullets to divert them.

00:14:42.371 --> 00:14:45.534
That is a skill worthy of the Juttensen.

00:14:45.875 --> 00:14:49.902
But, those are obviously
defensive skills.

00:14:50.045 --> 00:14:54.607
Furthermore, a revolver
only has six shots.

00:14:55.518 --> 00:14:59.784
If I have her head, I will be made
one of the Juttensen for sure!

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:06.423
You may have been able to deal with one
cannon, but how will you handle four?

00:15:06.529 --> 00:15:08.156
This battle is over!

00:15:39.161 --> 00:15:40.822
O-One shot.

00:15:41.297 --> 00:15:44.755
That storm of bullets
with just one shot...

00:15:45.201 --> 00:15:50.696
...one bullet to split the lead bullet and
caused the fragments to destroy the rest.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:55.641
Can it be that she really stops all
those bullets with just one bullet?

00:16:00.149 --> 00:16:03.641
I see you removed some of your armor.

00:16:05.721 --> 00:16:06.881
Wow.

00:16:08.724 --> 00:16:14.390
Would you like me to remove more,
or will you come out willingly?

00:16:16.365 --> 00:16:19.061
Shall I strip you of that cannon, too?

00:16:19.168 --> 00:16:21.261
Woman, stop right there.

00:16:21.537 --> 00:16:22.936
Throw away your gun.

00:16:23.038 --> 00:16:23.902
Rushuna.

00:16:24.373 --> 00:16:26.773
Hurry up and throw it away!

00:16:26.876 --> 00:16:28.810
Don't do it, Rushuna!

00:16:33.649 --> 00:16:34.581
Rushuna!

00:16:36.719 --> 00:16:40.280
Professor, take the girl out!

00:16:40.656 --> 00:16:41.554
Right.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:44.258
It looks like our tables have turned!

00:16:44.894 --> 00:16:49.194
Do we save the head of
the fugitive or her body?

00:16:50.032 --> 00:16:52.660
Even that choice is a delicate one.

00:16:53.736 --> 00:16:58.173
Don't move unless you don't care
what happens to the brat.

00:16:58.274 --> 00:16:59.263
Run!

00:17:02.711 --> 00:17:04.008
Mikan.

00:17:05.748 --> 00:17:10.879
Do you know why Miss Touka
wouldn't help you seek revenge?

00:17:11.987 --> 00:17:13.249
What's that about?

00:17:13.689 --> 00:17:16.817
If you kill someone
you have a grudge against...

00:17:16.926 --> 00:17:21.124
...someone will then have a grudge
against you and will try to kill you.

00:17:21.297 --> 00:17:23.492
The fighting will not end.

00:17:25.668 --> 00:17:28.967
If you resent someone,
it will only come back to you.

00:17:29.238 --> 00:17:33.197
Miss Touka didn't want you
to be that kind of person.

00:17:36.111 --> 00:17:39.979
I'm sure your parents
would feel the same way.

00:17:44.019 --> 00:17:45.316
Rushuna.

00:17:45.654 --> 00:17:50.091
The man against whom you seek
vengeance is a pitiful man who can't do...

00:17:50.192 --> 00:17:51.682
...anything on his own.

00:17:51.794 --> 00:17:56.060
Shut up, woman.
You don't think I can shoot her?

00:17:56.799 --> 00:17:57.697
Get down!

00:18:02.338 --> 00:18:03.464
How ridiculous!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.732
Rushuna!

00:18:08.677 --> 00:18:13.740
What a stupid woman. AII because
she tried to save the hostage.

00:18:13.916 --> 00:18:16.817
She underestimated
the powers of Kibanten.

00:18:18.721 --> 00:18:19.779
Sharp!

00:18:23.058 --> 00:18:24.423
She dodged it!

00:18:27.529 --> 00:18:29.963
I will remove your cannon!

00:18:30.199 --> 00:18:31.860
With that gun?

00:18:32.801 --> 00:18:35.770
You can't even make a
single scratch with that!

00:18:37.406 --> 00:18:39.208
Zero Range Target Shot!

00:18:39.208 --> 00:18:40.436
<i>ZERO RANGE TARGETSHOT
Zero Range Target Shot!</i>

00:18:40.542 --> 00:18:42.009
Full impact!

00:18:42.244 --> 00:18:43.711
<i>FULL SIX BULLETS IMPACT</i>

00:19:15.978 --> 00:19:17.741
Rushuna, what was that?

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.741
I destroyed the cannon...

00:19:19.848 --> 00:19:23.306
...in order to cause the other
nearby ammunition to explode.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:28.886
I couldn't destroy the cannon
with just one shot, so I tried...

00:19:29.024 --> 00:19:31.117
...shooting six bullets at once.

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:35.219
In other words, I removed his
armor and stripped him naked.

00:19:43.105 --> 00:19:48.008
I'm sure they've lost their places
in this world to war, poor people.

00:20:27.149 --> 00:20:28.377
Don't shoot me!

00:20:28.517 --> 00:20:30.747
Don't shoot me! Don't shoot me!

00:20:30.886 --> 00:20:32.820
Please don't shoot me!

00:20:32.955 --> 00:20:35.389
I don't feel sorry for you!

00:20:35.724 --> 00:20:39.626
My dad and my mom...
Because of you...

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:43.027
Because of you...

00:20:43.198 --> 00:20:45.758
Please don't shoot me!

00:20:47.035 --> 00:20:47.899
Mikan!

00:20:56.011 --> 00:20:57.774
A man like you...

00:20:59.414 --> 00:21:01.041
A man like you...

00:21:15.664 --> 00:21:19.828
...is a waste to hold a grudge against.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.877
Thank you.

00:21:42.891 --> 00:21:45.451
You erased Mikan's will to fight.

00:21:56.939 --> 00:22:00.102
What a wonderful sight...

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:06.108
Pan...

00:22:06.381 --> 00:22:06.848
<i>PANTIES...</i>

00:22:06.848 --> 00:22:07.449
<i>PANTIES...
Pan...</i>

00:22:07.449 --> 00:22:08.183
<i>PANTIES...</i>

00:22:08.183 --> 00:22:08.884
<i>PANTIES...
Pan...</i>

00:22:08.884 --> 00:22:09.718
<i>PANTIES...</i>

00:22:09.718 --> 00:22:10.650
<i>PANTIES...
Pan...</i>

00:22:16.158 --> 00:22:25.794
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.868 --> 00:22:36.539
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.846 --> 00:22:43.079
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:43.252 --> 00:22:47.313
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:48.390 --> 00:22:56.126
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:56.465 --> 00:22:58.558
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.834 --> 00:23:03.965
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:04.172 --> 00:23:09.610
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.811 --> 00:23:19.812
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:20.155 --> 00:23:30.963
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:31.133 --> 00:23:41.737
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.845 --> 00:23:45.813
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:46.381 --> 00:23:49.782
Mikan has joined us
and our journey resumes.

00:23:49.918 --> 00:23:51.317
Destination, Tento.

00:23:51.420 --> 00:23:54.821
I must ask Tenshi directly
for an explanation...

00:23:54.923 --> 00:23:57.983
But one of the Juttensen attacks us.

00:23:58.093 --> 00:24:02.325
The Juttensen are the strongest Senshi
who serve to protect Tenshi.

00:24:02.431 --> 00:24:06.231
Tenshi, are you serious or are you...

00:24:06.435 --> 00:24:10.929
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
Destination Tento.

00:24:11.039 --> 00:24:13.337
Would you like to join me?
